# Baked into the bundle at build time by next build — NOT read from Worker
# variables at runtime. The console links out to both public sites (the rail's
# "Open site" links, and the note on /settings about where these edits do and
# do not land), so it needs all three URLs.
# Change any of them and you must rebuild, not just redeploy.
NEXT_PUBLIC_MARKETPLACE_URL=https://vezlist-new-marketplace.vezlistofficial.workers.dev
NEXT_PUBLIC_PERSONALS_URL=https://vezlist-new-personals.vezlistofficial.workers.dev
NEXT_PUBLIC_ADMIN_URL=https://vezlist-new-admin.vezlistofficial.workers.dev
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://api-staging.vezlist.cc/api/v1
